+///   these values, the time step's length and options.softWalls, which are
+///   checked to be those of the record.
+/// - The sections without a record per slot (trachea, the rest of the nose, the
+///   sinuses) are checked to be the same in every slot that is recorded, so
+///   they still hold what the time step of the slot before left in them.
